WEBVTT

00:08.000 --> 00:09.344
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.413 --> 00:10.965
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:11.034 --> 00:12.482
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.551 --> 00:14.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.655 --> 00:17.586
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.655 --> 00:19.620
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.689 --> 00:21.689
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.758 --> 00:23.517
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.586 --> 00:25.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.517 --> 00:27.655
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.724 --> 00:29.724
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.793 --> 00:31.620
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.689 --> 00:33.620
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.689 --> 00:35.413
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.482 --> 00:37.724
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.793 --> 00:39.655
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.724 --> 00:40.965
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.034 --> 00:42.827
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.896 --> 00:45.551
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.620 --> 00:47.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.931 --> 00:49.620
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:01.758 --> 01:04.862
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:10.310 --> 01:12.793
- SpongeBob!
Spatula down, sailor.
- 海绵宝宝！
放下铲子，水手。

01:12.862 --> 01:15.068
- What's going on,
Mr. Krabs?
- 发生了什么事，
蟹老板？

01:15.137 --> 01:17.965
- According to the nice man
from the Labor Authority,
- 据好人说
来自劳工局，

01:18.034 --> 01:20.655
it's time for
your break, boy-o.
是时候了
你休息一下吧，小伙子。

01:20.724 --> 01:22.379
- We get breaks?
- 我们有休息时间吗？

01:22.448 --> 01:25.068
- Krabs!
- 螃蟹！

01:25.137 --> 01:27.379
- [chuckles]
Well, of course you do, boy-o.
- [轻笑]
嗯，你当然知道，男孩。

01:27.448 --> 01:29.758
Why, if I don't give you
a five-minute break
为什么，如果我不给你
休息五分钟

01:29.827 --> 01:31.482
once every 20 years,
每20年一次，

01:31.551 --> 01:34.724
this lovely man
could fine me big bucks.
这个可爱的男人
可能会罚款我一大笔钱。

01:34.793 --> 01:37.517
- Nice meeting you.
- 很高兴认识你。

01:41.137 --> 01:44.758
- And you don't want me
to get fined, do you?
- 而你不想要我
会被罚款吗？

01:44.827 --> 01:46.517
- [gasps]
No!
- [喘气]
不！

01:46.586 --> 01:48.172
Never.
绝不。

01:48.241 --> 01:51.034
- Good.
Then you just sit here
- 好的。
然后你就坐在这里

01:51.103 --> 01:53.724
and don't do or say
nothing for five minutes.
不要做或说
五分钟内什么也没有。

01:53.793 --> 01:55.241
Oh--
哦 -

01:55.310 --> 01:58.413
and enjoy your break.
[laughs]
并享受你的休息时间。
[笑]

01:58.482 --> 02:00.655
- Okay.
- 好的。

02:01.793 --> 02:06.344
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

02:06.413 --> 02:08.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:08.931 --> 02:11.517
[gasps]
[喘气]

02:11.586 --> 02:13.000
Oh!
哦！

02:13.068 --> 02:15.862
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:15.931 --> 02:18.275
- SpongeBob!
What are you doing?
- 海绵宝宝！
你在干什么？

02:18.344 --> 02:20.448
- Uh, I just spotted a spot.
- 呃，我刚刚发现了一个地方。

02:20.517 --> 02:22.965
- You can't work
on your break, boy-o.
- 你不能工作
休息吧，小伙子。

02:23.034 --> 02:25.793
Period.
Remember the fines?
时期。
还记得罚款吗？

02:25.862 --> 02:28.137
- I knew it!
- 我就知道！

02:28.206 --> 02:31.241
I've had my eye
on you for years, Krabs.
我已经有眼睛了
蟹蟹，你已经追随你很多年了。

02:31.310 --> 02:33.655
Oh, this violation
哦，这个违规

02:33.724 --> 02:36.379
is really gonna cost you.
真的会让你付出代价。

02:36.448 --> 02:39.103
Hmm...
唔...

02:39.172 --> 02:41.310
- [yelps]
Oh, I can see we're gonna
- [尖叫声]
哦，我看得出来我们会

02:41.379 --> 02:44.482
have to take
drastic measures here.
必须采取
这里采取严厉措施。

02:44.551 --> 02:47.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:50.689 --> 02:52.620
[sighs]
[叹气]

02:52.689 --> 02:55.103
- "Employee break room"?
- “员工休息室”？

02:55.172 --> 02:57.758
I never knew this was here.
我从来不知道这是在这里。

02:59.275 --> 03:01.551
[creatures chittering]
[生物叽叽喳喳]

03:01.620 --> 03:04.448
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

03:10.586 --> 03:14.517
[gasps]
Oh, it's beautiful.
[喘气]
哦，很漂亮。

03:14.586 --> 03:18.241
Like stepping through a portal
into the magical realm beyond.
就像踏入传送门一样
进入更远的魔法境界。

03:18.310 --> 03:21.931
- Yeah, whatever.
Five minutes.
- 是的，无论如何。
五分钟。

03:22.000 --> 03:25.793
- I just hope there's enough
time to enjoy everything.
- 我只是希望有足够的
是时候享受一切了。

03:25.862 --> 03:28.724
Ooh!
哦！

03:32.862 --> 03:35.068
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:35.137 --> 03:37.689
Ooh.
哦。

03:37.758 --> 03:39.793
[laughs]
[笑]

03:39.862 --> 03:42.793
Enjoy your carousel,
my little hot dog friends.
享受你的旋转木马，
我的小热狗朋友们。

03:42.862 --> 03:45.344
[laughs]
[笑]

03:49.793 --> 03:52.517
Surf's up!
冲浪起来了！

03:56.620 --> 03:59.034
Wipe out.
消灭。

03:59.103 --> 04:02.586
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

04:02.655 --> 04:09.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:11.724 --> 04:13.172
[gulping]
[吞咽]

04:13.241 --> 04:15.275
I think this used to be...
我想这曾经是...

04:15.344 --> 04:16.827
creamed corn!
奶油玉米！

04:16.896 --> 04:18.379
- Sorry, bub.
- 对不起，小伙子。

04:18.448 --> 04:20.655
I was meatloaf
before I expired.
我是肉饼
在我过期之前。

04:20.724 --> 04:23.724
[laughs]
- Oh, Globby, you're so silly.
[笑]
- 哦，格洛比，你真傻。

04:23.793 --> 04:26.206
[laughing]
[笑]

04:28.655 --> 04:32.827
[music warping]
[音乐扭曲]

04:36.482 --> 04:37.379
Bah bah!
呸呸！

04:37.448 --> 04:39.206
My break room band.
我的休息室乐队。

04:39.275 --> 04:41.379
Scrubby and the Cleaning Crew.
斯克鲁比和清洁工。

04:41.448 --> 04:42.620
Hmm...
唔...

04:42.689 --> 04:45.379
Let's see if I wired
everything right.
让我们看看我是否连线
一切都正确。

04:48.448 --> 04:49.862
Perfect.
完美的。

04:49.931 --> 04:51.689
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

04:51.758 --> 04:52.931
Yeah!
是的！

04:53.000 --> 04:59.448
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:59.517 --> 05:03.344
- Huh?
Ooh, music.
- 啊？
哦，音乐。

05:03.413 --> 05:05.793
I didn't know
the Krusty Krab had a lounge.
我不知道
蟹堡王有一个休息室。

05:05.862 --> 05:07.862
Ooh!
哦！

05:07.931 --> 05:11.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:11.655 --> 05:13.793
- Shake a leg.
- 摇一摇腿。

05:13.862 --> 05:16.137
- Oh, come on in, everyone.
- 哦，大家进来吧。

05:16.206 --> 05:18.724
Try the funk, it's fresh.
尝试一下funk，很新鲜。

05:18.793 --> 05:22.241
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

05:28.241 --> 05:31.517
- I sure dig that.
There we go, yes.
- 我确实喜欢这一点。
就这样，是的。

05:31.586 --> 05:33.620
- [humming]
Huh?
- [嗡嗡声]
啊？

05:33.689 --> 05:36.620
Where'd all me
paying customers go?
我都去哪儿了
付费客户去哪？

05:36.689 --> 05:38.793
[music thumping]
[音乐震耳欲聋]

05:38.862 --> 05:41.965
What--ow.
What the--
什么——噢。
什么是——

05:42.034 --> 05:44.241
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

05:44.310 --> 05:46.724
A party?
I don't remember charging
聚会？
我不记得充电过

05:46.793 --> 05:49.034
anyone for a party
on me premises.
任何人参加聚会
在我的场地上。

05:49.103 --> 05:52.000
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

05:52.068 --> 05:54.724
- Oh yeah!
- 哦，是的！

05:56.551 --> 06:00.000
- All right, that's it.
Five minutes are up, SpongeBob.
- 好吧，就是这样。
五分钟到了，海绵宝宝。

06:00.068 --> 06:02.413
Break's over, everyone out.
休息结束了，大家都出去了。

06:02.482 --> 06:05.758
Everyone out.
Out, out, out, out, out.
大家都出去吧。
出去，出去，出去，出去，出去。

06:05.827 --> 06:09.000
- You're in compliance
this time, Krabs.
- 你遵守规定
这次是蟹蟹。

06:09.068 --> 06:11.620
After a break at my house!
到我家休息后！

06:11.689 --> 06:14.034
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

06:14.103 --> 06:17.241
- Oh, Mr. Krabs,
that was so much fun.
-哦，蟹老板先生，
太有趣了。

06:17.310 --> 06:21.068
I can't wait for my
next break in 20 years.
我等不及我的了
20年后的下一次休息。

06:21.137 --> 06:24.310
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:34.793 --> 06:36.965
Well, I'm glad
you enjoyed it, boy-o,
嗯，我很高兴
你很享受，男孩，

06:37.034 --> 06:39.551
'cause it's time you
got back to making me money.
因为你是时候了
又开始为我赚钱了。

06:39.620 --> 06:42.965
- Yes, sir, Mr. Krabs.
- [laughing]
- 是的，先生，蟹老板。
- [笑]

06:46.344 --> 06:49.068
- Huh, wonder where
Squidward got to.
- 呵呵，想知道在哪里
章鱼哥必须这么做。

06:49.137 --> 06:51.827
Oh, well.
[whistling]
那好吧。
[吹口哨]

06:54.034 --> 06:55.689
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

06:55.758 --> 06:58.310
Hey, bub, have you
seen my lid anywhere?
嘿，小伙子，有你吗
在任何地方看到我的盖子吗？

06:58.379 --> 07:00.793
[yells]
- Sorry,
[喊叫]
- 抱歉，

07:00.862 --> 07:04.862
I'm on my break.
我正在休息。

我正在休息。